     geometry, edge routing, perimeter, marker, and model definitions from
     `src/main/webapp/mxgraph/src/*`, `src/main/webapp/js/grapheditor/Shapes.js`,
     and `src/main/webapp/js/shapes-14-6-5.min.js`.
   - `vendor/drawio-oss/stencils-map.json`: Extracted stencil XML dictionary from
     `src/main/webapp/js/stencils.min.js`.
   - `vendor/drawio-oss/default-style.xml` and `dark-default-style.xml`:
     Extracted from `src/main/webapp/styles/default.xml` and `dark-default.xml`.
   - `src/png-meta.mjs`: ESM port of `writePngWithText` and PNG chunk XML extraction
     from `drawio-desktop/src/main/electron.js`.
   - `src/oss-runtime.mjs` and `src/renderer.mjs`: Pure Node.js (.mjs) adapter
     and headless SVG renderer modeled on `mxSvgCanvas2D`, `mxGraphView`, and
     `mxCellRenderer`.

